<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 820 million pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 820 million pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 820 million pesos in the secondary market on Thursday through two credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>    410 million     5 days</p>
<p>    410 million     1 days</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
